{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You want to endlessly roll dice and battle folklore monsters? We got you covered.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll magical dice, collect rare loot, nudge your fate in the right direction, slay folklore creatures and finally face the King of Undead, The Lich!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/b6ae71847c79690f90d7f81779ceb1e2.poster.avif?t=1767687815\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/b6ae71847c79690f90d7f81779ceb1e2.webm?t=1767687815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Die for the Lich, we set out to recreate the magic of playing a unique deck-builder for the first time.<br>We replaced cards with dice that you need to pair with your gear and the game took on a life of its own, a curious blend of strategy, chaos, and pushing your luck! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/46e8aba0e4f6363dca77fd8003cfb99f.poster.avif?t=1767687815\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415570/extras/46e8aba0e4f6363dca77fd8003cfb99f.webm?t=1767687815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you strike the perfect balance between dice, weapons, abilities and trinkets?<br>Do you wish to always roll what you need, then find a Lucky Die.<br>Do you need custom made dice, then visit the Dice Fusion table.<br>Do you want to re-roll 1s, then grab the Eye Patch ability.<br>Do you think you are strong enough for a tougher battle, then seek the Blood Moon.<br>The options are endless and there is nothing more exciting than having your own unique journey in a chaotic world.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Complete Act 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415570/0bb81cd65a86010ace84cad70a08f2062b780cdc.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Act 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415570/3c5e2197f777ae77cd1e1e444d76deb70ee13cbf.jpg"},{"name":"Complete Act 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415570/a797598706bb9b530f6677fc5392cfe3e65461fc.jpg"},{"name":"Undertaker Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415570/51b7dd8448c17a02f5858a20ccd2de1d2d7bade3.jpg"},{"name":"Dante Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415570/a715601e836cfc4cfa63280fe1036ab6cbea5494.jpg"},{"name":"The Forsaken Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415570/94f56dd781f24f4960d79054cf5eebc95aaa7287.jpg"},{"name":"Light Backpack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415570/8a5fa25af6c1c4e8c373fd80dca1223f8bdd6b9d.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415570/9ad5592fb1a0fa1815a19ce2c88d077294ddf7dc.jpg"},{"name":"Investor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415570/cd83e61dcf7d89200ff0549e4472550e6088a2c6.jpg"},{"name":"Groundhog Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3415570/2cd2d12369bbfbef36dfab8d8c36f0b1d4764106.jpg"}],"total":27},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3415570?t=1767687815","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_